{"_comment":"CPU reference for llamafile_backend.check_vectors (ch-33): opencoti-llamafile c14 r19 --gpu disable, qwen3-embedding-0.6b Q8_0, pooling last.","model":"qwen3-embedding:0.6b","gguf_sha256":"06507c7b42688469c4e7298b0a1e16deff06caf291cf0a5b278c308249c3e439","pooling":"last","texts":["how do I fix bcache cache-set superblock corruption?","def fibonacci(n):\n    return n if n < 2 else fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)","The hooks make the same calls deterministically, on every turn, before the model even sees the prompt. The model still sees a recalled context block in the prompt and decides what to do with it, but it cannot forget to look. Same on the way out: every turn that touched something noteworthy gets a chance to write back, again deterministically, and a provider failure never blocks the prompt."],"vectors":[[0.013498,-0.039766,-0.010676,-0.046767,0.030456,0.014808,-0.026151,0.036904,-0.055174,0.064734,-0.041407,-0.076758,0.02068,-0.009536,-0.040315,0.090141,0.072542,0.008307,-0.034543,0.093909,0.087645,0.001005,0.004169,0.054503,0.016437,-0.004564,-0.021623,-0.011845,0.009882,-0.026993,0.039298,-0.041341,-0.045199,-0.0489,0.00663,-0.013628,-0.03489,-0.036794,0.033521,0.046124,-0.017913,0.007365,0.054883,0.003896,-0.018462,-0.004477,0.064543,-0.02393,0.041305,-0.012588,-0.006313,0.019973,-0.023083,-0.023843,0.006611,0.00928,0.035109,-0.053962,0.015914,-0.034555,-0.014541,0.02971,-0.010351,-0.019666,-0.026054,0.055139,0.011322,0.001754,-0.002864,-0.009343,-0.009872,0.036784,-0.032857,0.036477,-0.041827,0.043608,0.014571,-0.036606,0.04454,0.079067,-0.003857,0.003784,0.020021,0.021147,-0.040634,0.045378,0.065916,-0.002418,-0.025671,-0.004229,-0.06777,0.042551,-0.010695,-0.031202,0.023288,-0.031706,0.01312,0.017122,-0.020498,-0.028532,-0.010528,0.035483,0.019983,-0.090133,-0.09641,0.089917,-0.036211,-0.005381,0.000193,-0.056514,0.029597,0.03748,-0.079091,-0.002769,-0.04334,0.006719,-0.000532,0.010685,0.019803,-0.019278,-0.012593,-0.014899,0.019341,-0